cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use scikit-allel2, please cite it with the DOI of the version you used,
  as below. scikit-allel2 continues scikit-allel; please also cite scikit-allel.
title: scikit-allel2
abstract: >-
  A Python package for exploring and analysing genetic variation data, with a
  parallel VCF reader written in Rust. scikit-allel2 continues scikit-allel for
  Python 3.12+, NumPy 2, zarr 3 and pandas 3.
type: software
# concept DOI: resolves to the latest version on Zenodo
